    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/2cbc7dde958ee5818f5ed7b400d77e8b.avif?t=1750533965\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms Bodycam 2 is the sequel to the realistic first-person shooter set in the Backrooms universe. Your goal is to survive and escape through multiple Backrooms levels. Find weapons to defend yourself against aggressive entities\u2014they will definitely try to catch you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/bfac1aa2806a243a3c8183a852e0e266.poster.avif?t=1750533965\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/bfac1aa2806a243a3c8183a852e0e266.webm?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/bfac1aa2806a243a3c8183a852e0e266.mp4?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/190d698834b4c519af35e83eecd1a515.avif?t=1750533965\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the endless Backrooms corridors, you can find an assault rifle, shotgun, or pistol. You can also use the weapon modification menu to equip your gun with a laser sight for better aiming or a flashlight to navigate the darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/dfb2a9ca44a632642930ed5318ccae97.poster.avif?t=1750533965\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/dfb2a9ca44a632642930ed5318ccae97.webm?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/dfb2a9ca44a632642930ed5318ccae97.mp4?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/7caa38a0c2a858c8461f69238364ea40.avif?t=1750533965\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features seven different Backrooms levels, and you must figure out how to escape from each of them. Explore eerie liminal spaces that seem to have no purpose in our world. The game includes levels such as: The Lobby (new), Habitable Zone, Under Sublimity, Abandoned Hospital, and Level ! (RUN). Can you survive here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/6dfe8ee0c2b871e6b39eec34b3344e24.poster.avif?t=1750533965\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/6dfe8ee0c2b871e6b39eec34b3344e24.webm?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/6dfe8ee0c2b871e6b39eec34b3344e24.mp4?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/a6fb6940dfb571baf3b78585710cf7fd.avif?t=1750533965\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the game through the lens of a bodycam attached to your character. The graphics, sound design, visual effects, and character animations are crafted to closely resemble the original &quot;found footage&quot; from the Backrooms. Essentially, this game is an immersive simulation\u2014an interactive tour through the eerie world of the Backrooms. Would you dare to enter?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/cd34f25758aaa0fa599f0fcd619c1792.poster.avif?t=1750533965\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/cd34f25758aaa0fa599f0fcd619c1792.webm?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/cd34f25758aaa0fa599f0fcd619c1792.mp4?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/2cbc7dde958ee5818f5ed7b400d77e8b.avif?t=1750533965\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms Bodycam 2 is the sequel to the realistic first-person shooter set in the Backrooms universe. Your goal is to survive and escape through multiple Backrooms levels. Find weapons to defend yourself against aggressive entities\u2014they will definitely try to catch you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/bfac1aa2806a243a3c8183a852e0e266.poster.avif?t=1750533965\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/bfac1aa2806a243a3c8183a852e0e266.webm?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/bfac1aa2806a243a3c8183a852e0e266.mp4?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/190d698834b4c519af35e83eecd1a515.avif?t=1750533965\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the endless Backrooms corridors, you can find an assault rifle, shotgun, or pistol. You can also use the weapon modification menu to equip your gun with a laser sight for better aiming or a flashlight to navigate the darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/dfb2a9ca44a632642930ed5318ccae97.poster.avif?t=1750533965\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/dfb2a9ca44a632642930ed5318ccae97.webm?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/dfb2a9ca44a632642930ed5318ccae97.mp4?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/7caa38a0c2a858c8461f69238364ea40.avif?t=1750533965\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features seven different Backrooms levels, and you must figure out how to escape from each of them. Explore eerie liminal spaces that seem to have no purpose in our world. The game includes levels such as: The Lobby (new), Habitable Zone, Under Sublimity, Abandoned Hospital, and Level ! (RUN). Can you survive here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/6dfe8ee0c2b871e6b39eec34b3344e24.poster.avif?t=1750533965\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/6dfe8ee0c2b871e6b39eec34b3344e24.webm?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/6dfe8ee0c2b871e6b39eec34b3344e24.mp4?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/a6fb6940dfb571baf3b78585710cf7fd.avif?t=1750533965\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the game through the lens of a bodycam attached to your character. The graphics, sound design, visual effects, and character animations are crafted to closely resemble the original &quot;found footage&quot; from the Backrooms. Essentially, this game is an immersive simulation\u2014an interactive tour through the eerie world of the Backrooms. Would you dare to enter?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/cd34f25758aaa0fa599f0fcd619c1792.poster.avif?t=1750533965\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/cd34f25758aaa0fa599f0fcd619c1792.webm?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775610/extras/cd34f25758aaa0fa599f0fcd619c1792.mp4?t=1750533965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
